:Overencumbered rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                  :Card ;
    :cardName "Overencumbered" ;
    :manaCost "{1}{W}" ;
    :manaValue "2"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    :hasCardType :Enchantment ;
    :hasSubType :Aura ;
    :hasRarity :Rare ;
    :hasColor :White ;
    :hasColorIdentity :White ;
    :isInSet :MagicTheGatheringFallout ;
    :cardNumber "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    :artist "Elizabeth Peiró" ;
    :hasLanguage :English ;
    # Note: keyword "Food" not defined in MagicCardsOntology
    :hasKeywordAbility :Enchant ;
    :printedText """Enchant opponent
When this Aura enters, enchanted opponent creates a Clue token, a Food token, and a Junk token.
At the beginning of combat on enchanted opponent's turn, that player may pay {1} for each artifact they control. If they don't, creatures can't attack this combat."""@en ;
    :oracleText """Enchant opponent
When this Aura enters, enchanted opponent creates a Clue token, a Food token, and a Junk token.
At the beginning of combat on enchanted opponent's turn, that player may pay {1} for each artifact they control. If they don't, creatures can't attack this combat."""@en ;
    :gathererUrl "https://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=652105"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    :scryfallUrl "https://scryfall.com/card/pip/18/overencumbered"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    :hasLegality
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Commander ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Standard ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Modern ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Legacy ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Vintage ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Pioneer ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Pauper ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ;
    :hasRuling
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """You can't sacrifice a Junk token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can't sacrifice a Junk token to activate its own ability and also to activate the second ability of Junk Jet."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for the card played from exile with a Junk token's ability. For example, if the exiled card is a land card, you may play it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Some spells and abilities that create Junk tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is illegal as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won't resolve and none of its effects happen. You won't create any Junk tokens."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-11-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """You can't sacrifice a Food to pay multiple costs. For example, you can't sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate Maraleaf Rider's ability."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-11-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Whatever you do, don't eat the delicious cards."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-11-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures, it's never a creature type."""@en ] .

