    :hasKeywordAbility :Haste ;
    :printedText """Haste
As long as an artifact entered the battlefield under your control this turn, creatures you control get +2/+2.
Battalion — Whenever Sentinel Sarah Lyons and at least two other creatures attack, Sentinel Sarah Lyons deals damage equal to the number of artifacts you control to target player."""@en ;
    :oracleText """Haste
As long as an artifact entered the battlefield under your control this turn, creatures you control get +2/+2.
Battalion — Whenever Sentinel Sarah Lyons and at least two other creatures attack, Sentinel Sarah Lyons deals damage equal to the number of artifacts you control to target player."""@en ;
    :gathererUrl "https://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=652205"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    :scryfallUrl "https://scryfall.com/card/pip/118/sentinel-sarah-lyons"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    :hasLegality
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Commander ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Standard ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Modern ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Legacy ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Vintage ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Pioneer ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Pauper ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ;
    :hasRuling
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Sentinel Sarah Lyons’s second ability only cares if one or more artifacts entered the battlefield under your control this turn. Your creatures won’t get more powerful if more than one artifact entered the battlefield under your control this turn."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """The three attacking creatures don’t have to be attacking the same player, planeswalker, or battle."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Once Sentinel Sarah Lyons’s battalion ability has triggered, it doesn’t matter how many creatures are still attacking when that ability resolves. It also doesn’t matter whether or not Sentinel Sarah Lyons is still attacking or on the battlefield."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Sentinel Sarah Lyons doesn’t have to have been on the battlefield at the point in the turn where an artifact entered the battlefield under your control. If an artifact enters the battlefield under your control and then Sentinel Sarah Lyons enters the battlefield under your control later in that turn, creatures you control will still get +2/+2 that turn as long as Sentinel Sarah Lyons remains on the battlefield and under your control."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Use the number of artifacts you control at the time Sentinel Sarah Lyons’s battalion ability resolves to determine how much damage to deal."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Once an artifact enters the battlefield under your control in a given turn, it doesn’t matter what happens to it later. Creatures you control will still get +2/+2 that turn as long as Sentinel Sarah Lyons is on the battlefield under your control."""@en ] .

:ShaunFatherOfSynths rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                  :Card ;
    :cardName "Shaun, Father of Synths" ;
    :manaCost "{3}{U}{R}" ;
    :manaValue "5"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    :hasSuperType :Legendary ;
    :hasCardType :Creature ;
    :hasSubType :Human ;
    :hasSubType :Scientist ;
    :hasRarity :Rare ;
    :hasColor :Blue ;
    :hasColor :Red ;
    :hasColorIdentity :Blue ;
    :hasColorIdentity :Red ;
    :isInSet :MagicTheGatheringFallout ;
    :cardNumber "119"^^xsd:integer ;
    :artist "Zuzanna Wużyk" ;
    :hasLanguage :English ;
    :power "3" ;
    :powerValue "3"^^xsd:integer ;
    :toughness "4" ;
    :toughnessValue "4"^^xsd:integer ;
    :printedText """Whenever you attack, you may create a tapped and attacking token that's a copy of target attacking legendary creature you control other than Shaun, except it's not legendary and it's a Synth artifact creature in addition to its other types.
When Shaun leaves the battlefield, exile all Synth tokens you control."""@en ;
    :oracleText """Whenever you attack, you may create a tapped and attacking token that's a copy of target attacking legendary creature you control other than Shaun, except it's not legendary and it's a Synth artifact creature in addition to its other types.
When Shaun leaves the battlefield, exile all Synth tokens you control."""@en ;
    :gathererUrl "https://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=652206"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    :scryfallUrl "https://scryfall.com/card/pip/119/shaun-father-of-synths"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    :hasLegality
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Commander ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Standard ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Modern ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Legacy ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Vintage ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Pioneer ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Pauper ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ;
    :hasRuling
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """You declare which player, planeswalker, or battle the token is attacking as you put it onto the battlefield. It doesn’t have to be attacking the same player, planeswalker, or battle that Shaun is attacking."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied creature will also work."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Except for the noted exceptions, the token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Shaun’s last ability will exile all Synth tokens you control, not just Synth tokens created by its first ability."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Although the token is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature. This means that abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks won’t trigger when it enters the battlefield attacking."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """If the copied creature is copying something else, then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied, with the noted exceptions."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """If the copied creature is a token, the token that’s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created that token, with the noted exceptions."""@en ] .

:Vault112SadisticSimulation rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                  :Card ;
    :cardName "Vault 112: Sadistic Simulation" ;
    :manaCost "{2}{U}{R}" ;
    :manaValue "4"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    :hasCardType :Enchantment ;
    :hasSubType :Saga ;
    :hasRarity :Rare ;
    :hasColor :Blue ;
    :hasColor :Red ;
    :hasColorIdentity :Blue ;
    :hasColorIdentity :Red ;
    :isInSet :MagicTheGatheringFallout ;
    :cardNumber "123"^^xsd:integer ;
    :artist "Anton Solovianchyk" ;
    :hasLanguage :English ;
    :printedText """(As this Saga enters and after your draw step, add a lore counter. Sacrifice after III.)
I, II — Tap up to one target creature and put a stun counter on it. You get {E}{E} (two energy counters).
III — Pay any amount of {E}. If you paid one or more {E} this way, shuffle your library, then exile that many cards from the top. You may play one of those cards without paying its mana cost."""@en ;
    :oracleText """(As this Saga enters and after your draw step, add a lore counter. Sacrifice after III.)
I, II — Tap up to one target creature and put a stun counter on it. You get {E}{E} (two energy counters).
III — Pay any amount of {E}. If you paid one or more {E} this way, shuffle your library, then exile that many cards from the top. You may play one of those cards without paying its mana cost."""@en ;
    :gathererUrl "https://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=652210"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    :scryfallUrl "https://scryfall.com/card/pip/123/vault-112:-sadistic-simulation"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    :hasLegality
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Commander ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Standard ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Modern ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Legacy ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Vintage ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Pioneer ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Pauper ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ;
    :hasRuling
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Some triggered abilities state that you “may pay” a certain amount of {E}. You can’t pay that amount multiple times to multiply the effect. You simply choose whether or not to pay that amount of {E} as the ability resolves."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Some triggered abilities that state that you “may pay” a certain amount of {E} describe an effect that happens “If you do.” In that case, no player may take actions to try to stop the ability’s effect after you make your choice. If the payment is followed by the phrase “When you do,” then you’ll choose any targets for that reflexive triggered ability and put it on the stack before players can take actions."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """If a spell or ability with one or more targets states that you “may pay” some amount of {E}, and each permanent that it targets has become an illegal target, the spell or ability won’t resolve. You can’t pay any {E} even if you want to."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They’re not associated with any specific permanents."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. You can’t pay more energy counters than you have. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Energy counters aren’t mana. They don’t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” can’t give you energy counters."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Some spells and abilities that give you {E} may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t get any {E}."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Keep track of how many energy counters each player has. Potential ways to track this include writing them down on paper or using dice, but any method that is clear and mutually agreeable is fine. (At higher levels of tournament play, dice may not be allowed for tracking counters that players have.)"""@en ] .

