        :rulingText """Some spells and abilities that give you {E} may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t get any {E}."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-03-08"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """When you pay {E} equal to the target nonland permanent’s mana value during the resolution of Behemoth of Vault 0’s last ability, a second “reflexive” ability triggers and is put onto the stack. This ability does not have a target. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal."""@en ] ,
